# ProxyBridge

Follow `docs/contracts/proxybridge-cli.md` and `docs/contracts/proxybridge-profile.md`.

- Pass the profile on stdin with `--profile -`. MUST NOT pass an arbitrary file path.
- MUST NOT build a shell command string. Use `exec.Command` with separate args.
- Parse stdout with fixtures per version. Unknown lines stay unclassified.
- MUST NOT treat `Extension: active` alone as proof the profile applied.
- One managed process. Graceful signal, then wait, then timeout.
- MUST NOT start the real CLI in unit tests.
